<title>AUSTRIA: Austria July unemployment 193,412,up 3.5 pct vs 96.</title>
<headline>Austria July unemployment 193,412,up 3.5 pct vs 96.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1997-08-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Social Affairs Ministry reported the following economic indicator details.</p>
<p> AUSTRIAN UNEMPLOYMENT	 JULY	 JUNE	   JULY 96</p>
<p> Percentage of workforce	n.a.	 4.5	    4.1</p>
<p> Total			    193,412    193,796	186,821</p>
<p>NOTE - The ministry is due to release percentage of workforce unemployed later on Tuesday. June figures may be subject to revision when full July data made available.</p>
<p>-- Vienna newsroom, +43-1 531 12 254</p>
</text>
